%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f235e9a96eb7bbb419458f22113d08f2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSystem.DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - text: "Ah, horse racing. A magnificent display of speed, instinct\u2026 and terrible
      decisions."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 1
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You see, darling, your steed's speed will depend on your aim. The more
      accurate your shots, the faster it will gallop.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 2
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Try not to waste them. It would be rather embarrassing if your thoroughbred
      ended up trotting while mine prances toward the finish line."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 1
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "And don't get your hopes up too high about the prize. There won't be any
      victory concert here\u2026 though, who knows, perhaps your horse has more musical
      talent than you do."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c73fbfa91484ca43a982420233c0fdd, type: 2}
    spriteIndex: 3
    particlePrefab: {fileID: 0}
